  "alt": "A model of an authored fact sits at the top. The load-bearing solid path runs MODEL to\n    CONSUME (read the model live rather than copy its facts) to CORRESPONDENCE (compare model against the\n    world) to a disagreement decision that gates the disagreement or passes it as valid. Two enhancements\n    attach as dashed, open-arrowed strengtheners: EMIT (generate downstream artifacts from the model) and\n    DERIVE (compute correspondence from stable identities). They are useful but not required: a descriptive\n    model may stay advisory.",
